    "enUS": {
      "description": "The Wild King listens through shadows older than Hyjal itself. His scouts move with purpose now, stirred by the renewed advances of both Horde and Alliance in these sacred lands. The Blackthorne Pact feels the pressure of our resistance and grows more crazed each day.\r\n\r\nHunt down the Blackthorne Courier and end her trail before she carries their important information back to her master.\r\n\r\nShe moves between camps. Watch her path, and strike her down. Bring what she carries back to us.",
